#
# CS42L43 microcontroller patch (sdw_cs42l43.c), from the upstream kernel
# firmware collection (Cirrus Logic licence, LICENSE.cirrus):
cs42l43.bin
#
# not published upstream: asked for only as the last resort, when the
# file before it is missing:
#   intel/sof-ipc4/ehl/sof-ehl.ri  (no Intel-signed Elkhart Lake build)
